"Lexi is Kon's older brother by a year, an A-rank Meister of the Mind Writher."
"His Mind Writher is an alien whip that becomes a glowing white chain that cuts and wraps."
"He has an exploding reputation and a couple of suspensions."
"His full name is Lexi Roberts; he trains constantly and has explosive temper flares."
"At CNH he rooms with Haoyu, Alden Thorn and Lute, to whom he hasn't spoken in a year."
"His birthday is February 18; he speaks Russian and took ballet classes until recently."
"His little sister Irina is four and loves turtles."
"He got a boat as his Shit Sixteen present."
"He wanted the Sciences program, and fumed that the System gave Lute two S skills."
"He wants to be Avowed event security, to protect his parents and their ballet company."
"He calls Anesidora the place that actually wants Avowed."
"He brought Alden an anti-emetic after his leveling and told him: I don't hate you."
"In the flood his little white boat ended up stuck on the Nilama building's roof."
"He lost his house in the flood, and kept the donation list for Alden's Matadero potluck."
"He is only the second known Mind Writher Meister; the first died unregistered decades ago."
"In the December gym challenge his Writher landed the killing blow on Instructor Klein."
"In January 2041 he got his first System level-up; he may later grow Mind Writher longer."
